pageType: content
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 34, 300, 18]
    content: {style: "$kicker", wrap: false, text: 06 · 合约交互}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 54, 840, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: 从登记到兑付的完整链上时序
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [60, 102, 840, 1]
    viewBox: [840, 1]
    points: "0,0 840,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: seq-img
    elementType: image
    bounds: [60, 112, 470, 392]
    src: media/02-contract-interaction.png
    fit: {mode: contain}
  - elementId: pt1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [560, 130, 340, 100]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>确认即确权</strong> —— confirmInvoice 一笔交易内完成 InvoiceConfirmed 与 ReceivableMinted，凭证自动到供应商账上。</p>
  - elementId: pt2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [560, 245, 340, 100]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>成交是原子的</strong> —— acceptQuote 在同一笔交易里完成「凭证划转 + mUSD 转账」，任一步失败整笔回滚，没有中间状态。</p>
  - elementId: pt3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [560, 360, 340, 100]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>报价先锁资</strong> —— submitQuote 要求资金方先 approve 并锁定资金，供应商接受时不会因余额不足而失败。</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 508, 400, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, text: SC6113 · 供应链金融 DApp}
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 508, 40, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "07"}
